# ros2_control
It is a standard ROS2 framework which bridges software commands with hardware simulation.
How to setup the ros2_control ?
- Add the ros2_control tag in the main urdf file.
- Add the gz_ros2_control plugin to Gazebo in to the main urdf file
- Create a controller .yaml config file: to sets up a joint_trajector_controller (for smooth walking animations)
- Update the launch file







